Source: Department of State, Central Files, 611.37/7–1160. Secret; Priority;
                    Limit Distribution. Drafted by Hill;
                    cleared with Rubottom, Jamison,
                        Wieland, and Merchant (in substance); and approved by
                        Hill who signed for Herter. Sent to all ARA missions except Havana, and repeated to Havana and USUN.
